<description>&lt;p&gt;The Syrian People’s Assembly is advancing a broad legislative overhaul covering employment, penal, property and national security law, while Qatar’s intelligence chief says the country revamped its entire defence system in six hours. Turkish forces reaffirm their commitment to stay in Syria and Iraq until border security is guaranteed, and armed groups have launched drone attacks against al-Jolani regime security posts. Syrian Kurds are reported to prefer Bashar al-Assad over Erdogan, and Druze communities in the Golan Heights are described as warming to Israel, contrasting earlier reports of Israeli support for Druze forces. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/20/qatar-revamped-its-entire-defence-system-in-six-hours-intelligence-chief-reveals&quot;&gt;euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Syrian Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNdkpTQUV0d2xTTnhNRlRXSlcxQzAxMjAxRTdxa0JnYWFqUXY5UDhsRTkyYUFXS3hnNU04aW9kaUsxdGllbjRYUlZWaHZXRHRlMzgwaFVFNTh6ZzRIRjB2c0UxTmVVUUZ1Qm1aSDhtV0x1ZnphQzZzQkdHN3hpdjJyb01XZEFlZXd4UWVhZEczdFBQWW5yal81SUt1MUloeEV3MnpvTlI5T3hpUnYtSXA3NXlXTjFIUy1MOXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ITVX&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPRHpvN0hFNDJqNDAxWWZvUXNySUh5UEZyLTFkZE9oZ3NCOHlFN2NlaTVzbTIxWmNScVg3SUR5enQ1RGo3NXRrYVl6WlJCZlFGQndINzdGdXlHbjgyei1jMW5PYVhzX2tzX25NcDJ0SDlxdXRjSktPLUN4UnBmUzRTMTNkdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Amwaj.media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOYWZoZ0tLZGdiUmpRZDZsalhLSjJHRFJPV3lIQ2dySm84eDU0VjgtbnBQa1EtSGgtX3RQWDdKdGlONFdBbTd4Y1lhYVN3dDY4S2VSd2lNSzBaQ3IweGtNaTYxNDMzOWR5X3JFa3hEZ0xzRE1TWWFudGxSS3d0RUsyczJQVEV1ZmNvR3EwQ1VqcE9qdDJKemRGVzF